{
  "info": {
    "name": "Torneo Germans Bisbal API",
    "description": "REST API for the Torneo Germans Bisbal tournament management platform.\n\nAuth: most write endpoints require a Bearer access_token (ROLE_ADMIN for tournament-data writes). Run **Auth > Login** first \u2014 set `{{access_token}}` at the collection level from the response, or add a small post-response script to Login that does it for you:\n\n```js\npm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', pm.response.json().access_token);\n```\n\nEndpoints marked with \u26a0\ufe0f have request bodies inferred from the frontend and naming conventions (the DTO source files weren't available when this collection was generated) \u2014 double check field names against `backend/src/main/java/.../dto/` before relying on them.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
